Now make edits:

1. Fix bindJoystick preventDefault, add lostpointercapture, touch-ui class.
2. Free camera joystick controls in step.
3. Remove backdrop click close; add modal open timestamp maybe not needed but add guard anyway? Removing entirely is what user wants. Keep Escape and X.
4. Help panel: open on click (not toggle), close on X; add joystick instructions.
5. CSS: joystick display only for touch-ui; mobile layout adjustments; telemetry centered.

Also ensure the "turn" joystick label etc. Let me write CSS carefully. Since the file is minified lines, I'll append a new block at the end instead of editing huge lines — easier and safe. CSS later rules win (same specificity). But media queries: appending at end with its own media queries works.

