Wait orbitYaw sign: dragging right (dx>0) does `orbitYaw-=dx*.005` → camera moves... whichever. For joystick right (jt.x>0) use `orbitYaw-=jt.x*dt*1.7` consistent with drag. And jt.y>0 (down) → orbitPitch increases (camera higher) consistent with drag `orbitPitch+dy*.004`. So pushing down raises camera → looks down. Acceptable.

